   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "I'll do it for you",
     "texto": [
      "To offer to do something for someone, use **-아/어 줄게요** (I'll do it for you, I'll help you): 도와주다 → **도와줄게요** (I'll help you), 가져다주다 → **가져다줄게요** (I'll bring it to you).",
      "제가 **도와줄게요** = I'll help you."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Form and recipient",
     "texto": [
      "**-아/어 주다** («to do something for someone») is combined with **-(으)ㄹ게요**: 도와주다 → **도와줄게요**. The speaker offers to carry out the action for another person. Contrast **도와 주세요** (please help me, asking someone) with **도와줄게요** (I'll help you). The recipient can be marked with **한테/에게**: 친구한테 알려 줄게요 (I'll tell my friend)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
